//- views/panels/_weapons_panel.pug
//- Weapons repeating section. Weapon profiles from the rulebook's
//- Chapter 7 (Melee & Ranged Weapon Profiles tables). Declared at the top
//- of this file (pug compile-time scope) so the runtime auto-fill lookup
//- table (JSON-embedded into +module. below) is generated from this
//- object rather than hand-typed separately. The Name dropdown's
//- +option() calls below are written out individually rather than
//- generated from these same keys via an `each` loop - see
//- lessons_learned.md for the k-scaffold mixin bug that causes. Each
//- +option() value below must still match a key here exactly, or that
//- weapon's row just won't auto-fill (falls back to a no-op, not a
//- crash - see ccApplyWeaponPreset).
//- Axe and Javelin appear in both tables with slightly different stats
//- (Reach vs Range, different Focus) per RAW, so each profile is listed
//- separately with a disambiguating suffix. Field keys match the weapon
//- repeating section's own attribute suffixes exactly (reach_range,
//- damage_effects) so the auto-fill function can set them directly
//- without a separate name-mapping table.
-
